      "fine_trace_step": 6,
      "description": "ASan crash site. `flb_sds_cat()` copies `len` bytes from `str` into the SDS buffer; on the crashing path `str` still points at stack `temp` and `len` is 313, so `memcpy()` reads beyond the 48-byte local array."
